IPL Ticket Rush
DAIICT college students want to attend an IPL match.
A total of 𝑁 students from the college want to go while only M tickets are available for the match.
Determine how many students won't be able to book tickets.

input
4
5 3
5 7
4 1
8 8

output
2
0
3
0

=====
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    n,m=map(int,input().split())
    if n-m>0:
        print(n-m)
    else:
        print("0")
